Package: reeframe-backend
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Reeframe contributors <https://github.com/reetmlabs/reeframe-backend>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/reetmlabs/reeframe-backend
Description: Reeframe VMS — pipeline-driven video management system
 A Rust-native video management system built around a composable pipeline DAG.
 Records RTSP camera streams as chunked MP4 files, with automatic reconnection
 and per-credential AES-256-GCM encryption at rest.
 .
 This package installs the daemon (vms-daemon) and a systemd unit file.
 VMS_ENCRYPTION_KEY and VMS_AUTH__JWT_SECRET must be set in /etc/reeframe/env
 before the service can start.
Depends: libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.20),
         libgstreamer-plugins-bad1.0-0 (>= 1.20),
         libgstrtspserver-1.0-0 (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-base (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-good (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-libav (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly (>= 1.20),
         libssl3,
         ca-certificates,
         libsqlite3-0,
         systemd
